OL,3,GNEWSASatellite wi-fi funding for all
OL,4,AGWR trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers on Great Western Railway
OL,7,F(GWR) trains between London and the
OL,8,FWestcountry will be able to use
OL,9,Fsatellite wi-fi on board, after the
OL,10,Fgovernment confirmed funding.
OL,12,FHM Treasury confirmed funding in a
OL,13,Fletter to MPs for the rollout of the
OL,14,Fsatellite technology originally
OL,15,Fdeveloped for Formula 1 cars, which it
OL,16,Fdescribed as "a trailblazer project".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
