OL,3,GNEWSASatellite wi-fi funding for all
OL,4,AGWR trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FGWR previously carried out a trial of
OL,7,Fthe hybrid system, which uses both
OL,8,Fsignals from mobile phone masts on the
OL,9,Fground and low earth orbit (LEO)
OL,10,Fsatellites in space, to provide fast
OL,11,Fand consistent wi-fi.
OL,13,FThe government decision follows a
OL,14,Fcross-party campaign by MPs in the west
OL,15,Fand south-west of England.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
